  "releaseNotes": "- Moves Mixins.Disposable to 1.1 for the new record and option diagnostics\n- Adds llms.txt and llms-full.txt for every package, a root index, and context7.json\n- Corrects the package READMEs against the verified behavior\n- Restricts the disposable mixin to classes, diagnoses records and contradictory options, and stabilizes hint names\n- Generates T4 output per target framework, packs the llms files, and binds dependency ranges to the referenced version\n- Adds PublicApiAnalyzers with shipped API baseline\n- Fixes all diagnostics from the new analyzers\n- Regenerates lock files for new analyzer packages\n- Adds analyzers, .editorconfig, and banned API enforcement",
